<font color="white">ke ruang operasi saat dia sakit?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:07:09.262 --> 00:07:12.473
<font color="white">Saat aku pingsan setelah dipulangkan,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:07:12.557 --> 00:07:14.559
