00:07:15.268 --> 00:07:17.228
<font color="white">Makanya kubawa Snuggles ke sini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:07:18.771 --> 00:07:21.524
<font color="white">Ini Lee Hyeon-a.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Umurnya delapan tahun, dan dia temanku.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

