<font color="white">Ya, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:07:23.025 --> 00:07:24.861
<font color="white">Hyeon-a anak yang berani.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:07:24.944 --> 00:07:29.449
<font color="white">Meski sakit, kau selalu beri tahu namamu</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan bagian mana yang sakit, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:07:31.451 --> 00:07:33.744
<font color="white">Orang dewasa pun tak akan sanggup.</font><font color="white"></font>

