<font color="white">Hyeon-a hebat sekali.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:37.290
<font color="white">Dokter Gye.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:07:38.374 --> 00:07:41.335
<font color="white">Snuggles masih hidup</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">setelah dioperasi, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

