00:07:45.965 --> 00:07:47.550
<font color="white">Aku tak tahu</font><font color="white"></font>

00:07:47.633 --> 00:07:50.678
<font color="white">apa maksudmu, tapi…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:07:51.429 --> 00:07:53.139
<font color="white">Kenapa tidak beli yang baru…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:07:55.558 --> 00:07:56.767
<font color="white">Yang benar saja.</font><font color="white"></font>

