00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:17.205
<font color="white">Aku paham, Dok.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:08:17.288 --> 00:08:19.874
<font color="white">Aku cuma ingin coba-coba, oke?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:08:22.502 --> 00:08:24.420
