<font color="white">Jadi, aku khawatir</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:50.712 --> 00:18:52.005
<font color="white">ada hal yang kulewatkan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:52.631 --> 00:18:55.676
<font color="white">Dulu anak magang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tak pernah diberi tugas begitu,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:18:55.759 --> 00:18:57.511
<font color="white">tapi belakangan ini selalu diberikan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:58.011 --> 00:18:59.012
<font color="white">Astaga.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:18:59.805 --> 00:19:00.722
<font color="white">Maaf, ya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:06.353 --> 00:19:08.438
<font color="white">Apa gunanya pusat penanganan anak?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:08.939 --> 00:19:11.775
<font color="white">Situasi ruang operasi di sana</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sama buruknya,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:19:11.859 --> 00:19:13.902
<font color="white">bahkan sebelum krisis medis</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">belakangan ini.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:19:13.986 --> 00:19:16.155
<font color="white">Banyak ruang operasi,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tapi tak ada dokter bedah.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:19:16.738 --> 00:19:18.157
<font color="white">Lalu kenapa dibangun?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:21.577
<font color="white">Dulu klaim subsidinya amat rendah</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan bagian bedah anak sempat diabaikan,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:24.079
<font color="white">jadi pemerintah naikkan tarifnya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">beberapa tahun lalu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:19:24.163 --> 00:19:26.165
<font color="white">Sekarang sektor ini memang menguntungkan,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:26.248 --> 00:19:28.792
<font color="white">tapi malah kacau</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">karena mereka memaksakan segalanya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:19:30.127 --> 00:19:34.173
<font color="white">Hei, pusat penanganan anak</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">akan sering meminta konsultasimu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:19:35.507 --> 00:19:36.383
<font color="white">Begitu, ya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:36.884 --> 00:19:38.135
<font color="white">Kalau begitu…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:38.218 --> 00:19:39.678
<font color="white">"Begitu, ya. Kalau begitu"?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:41.513 --> 00:19:43.140
<font color="white">Jangan pikirkan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:43.223 --> 00:19:44.349
<font color="white">Jangan macam-macam.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:44.433 --> 00:19:46.894
<font color="white">Cukup lakukan operasi yang ada.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:46.977 --> 00:19:48.562
<font color="white">Klausul soal operasi sesuai pilihanmu?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:48.645 --> 00:19:51.356
<font color="white">Kusertakan di kontrak</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">agar kau lebih bersemangat kerja.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:54.067
<font color="white">Padahal niatku hanyalah menaikkan tarifmu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:54.151 --> 00:19:56.028
<font color="white">Sepertinya kau memikirkannya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:56.111 --> 00:19:57.988
<font color="white">Dan itu membuatku gelisah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:19:58.488 --> 00:20:01.867
<font color="white">Tapi konon bedah anak</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">berbeda dengan bedah orang dewasa.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:20:02.367 --> 00:20:05.329
<font color="white">Pembuluh darah anak mudah pecah</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">meski hanya tertekan sedikit.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:20:05.829 --> 00:20:07.706
<font color="white">Kecuali kita spesialis bedah anak,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:07.789 --> 00:20:10.959
<font color="white">cuma segelintir dokter berpengalaman</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan berani yang mempertimbangkannya,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:20:11.585 --> 00:20:13.212
<font color="white">karena mereka amat kecil dan rapuh.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:15.005 --> 00:20:19.218
<font color="white">Dokter Gye melakukan operasi</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang menggemaskan dan luar biasa…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:20:20.677 --> 00:20:22.471
<font color="white">Kau pasti sibuk. Ayo pergi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:23.138 --> 00:20:24.056
<font color="white">Diam,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:24.139 --> 00:20:26.475
<font color="white">atau dia mengomeliku</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">karena lakukan hal yang tak menguntungkan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:20:27.726 --> 00:20:29.770
<font color="white">Si nenek pasti membesarkan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">kakak beradik itu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:20:29.853 --> 00:20:32.773
<font color="white">Aku penasaran dia sakit apa.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:34.358 --> 00:20:36.026
<font color="white">Tampaknya dia tak baik-baik saja.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:36.109 --> 00:20:37.069
<font color="white">"Dok…"</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:37.611 --> 00:20:40.656
<font color="white">"Dokter melakukan…"</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:41.406 --> 00:20:43.158
<font color="white">- "Mogok kerja".</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- "Mogok kerja".</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:20:43.951 --> 00:20:45.244
<font color="white">"La…"</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:45.327 --> 00:20:46.536
<font color="white">"Lawan".</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:47.204 --> 00:20:49.790
<font color="white">Ayo kembali dan baca buku cerita lagi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:49.873 --> 00:20:51.166
<font color="white">Tidak mau.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:54.878 --> 00:20:58.966
<font color="white">"Aksi mogok kerja".</font><font color="white"></font>

00:20:59.883 --> 00:21:01.218
<font color="white">Apa itu?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:01.301 --> 00:21:02.219
<font color="white">Apa artinya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:03.136 --> 00:21:04.596
<font color="white">Ayo kembali sekarang.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:06.932
<font color="white">Mogok kerja dokter!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:07.015 --> 00:21:09.893
<font color="white">Lawan! Aksi mogok kerja!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:09.977 --> 00:21:11.061
<font color="white">Diamlah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:11.144 --> 00:21:13.021
<font color="white">Mogok kerja dokter!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:13.105 --> 00:21:14.481
<font color="white">Aksi mogok kerja!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:14.564 --> 00:21:16.066
<font color="white">- Cukup sudah!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Terserah!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:21:21.238 --> 00:21:26.410
<font color="white">Cucu imut tersayang,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">cucu kesayangan Nenek.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:30.330
<font color="white">Si manis, Ga-eul.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:31.123 --> 00:21:32.666
<font color="white">Aku juga!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:34.501 --> 00:21:37.504
<font color="white">Si manis, Ga-yeong.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:38.088 --> 00:21:40.966
<font color="white">Cucu imut tersayang,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">cucu kesayangan Nenek…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:21:41.758 --> 00:21:45.304
<font color="white">cucu imut tersayang.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:54.146 --> 00:21:56.023
<font color="white">Yoo Ga-eul, umur sepuluh tahun.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:56.106 --> 00:21:57.441
{\an8}<font color="white">Setelah biopsi jarum,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:21:57.524 --> 00:21:59.401
{\an8}<font color="white">pasien terdiagnosis </font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>ganglioneuroblastoma</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white">.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:02.612
{\an8}<font color="white">Letaknya di area retroperitoneal,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:02.696 --> 00:22:05.657
{\an8}<font color="white">mengelilingi aorta, vena kava,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">arteri dan vena renalis kanan, dan ureter,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:22:05.741 --> 00:22:07.534
{\an8}<font color="white">dengan invasi ke kanalis spinalis.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:07.617 --> 00:22:10.287
{\an8}<font color="white">Kini aku paham kenapa butuh konsultasi</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">meski tumornya jinak.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:22:10.370 --> 00:22:11.621
{\an8}<font color="white">Penyebarannya cukup luas.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:11.705 --> 00:22:13.832
{\an8}<font color="white">Ya, secara klinis itu neuroblastoma.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:14.750 --> 00:22:16.501
{\an8}<font color="white">Dia sudah menjalani delapan sesi kemo,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:16.585 --> 00:22:18.295
{\an8}<font color="white">tapi ukurannya tidak berkurang.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:19.463 --> 00:22:21.798
<font color="white"><i>Ganglioneuroblastoma</i></font><font color="white"><font color="white">…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:22:21.882 --> 00:22:23.550
<font color="white">Hasil pemindaiannya juga jelas.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:23.633 --> 00:22:26.636
<font color="white">Dia harus dioperasi</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">karena tumor di kanalis spinalis</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:22:26.720 --> 00:22:28.805
<font color="white">menekan struktur di sekitarnya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:28.889 --> 00:22:30.140
<font color="white">Awalnya jadwal operasinya besok.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:31.975 --> 00:22:33.435
<font color="white">Mereka sangat kekurangan staf,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:33.518 --> 00:22:35.979
<font color="white">jadi minta konsultasi</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dari Bedah Saraf dan Bedah Umum.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:22:36.563 --> 00:22:38.607
<font color="white">Kemungkinan besar dia sangat kesakitan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:39.399 --> 00:22:40.984
<font color="white">Bukankah harus langsung dioperasi?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:41.068 --> 00:22:42.652
<font color="white">Tentu saja harus.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:42.736 --> 00:22:47.115
<font color="white">Tapi sekarang tak ada jalan keluar,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">jadi saling melempar tanggung jawab.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:22:48.450 --> 00:22:50.535
<font color="white">Operasinya ditunda sampai kapan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:50.619 --> 00:22:52.496
<font color="white">Entah sampai kapan</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:52.996 --> 00:22:54.915
<font color="white">karena tak ada dokter bedah dan asisten.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:22:54.998 --> 00:22:58.251
<font color="white">Kami coba merujuknya ke rumah sakit lain,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tapi mereka menolaknya</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:22:58.335 --> 00:23:00.796
<font color="white">karena penyebaran tumornya luas</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan butuh banyak spesialis.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:23:02.089 --> 00:23:03.256
<font color="white">Direktur Bu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:03.340 --> 00:23:05.967
<font color="white">Pemerintah mengambil tindakan hukum</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">terhadap dokter</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:23:06.051 --> 00:23:09.137
<font color="white">yang meninggalkan tugas</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan ikut mogok kerja.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:23:10.889 --> 00:23:12.015
<font color="white">Itu berarti…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:13.892 --> 00:23:15.602
<font color="white">Izin praktik mereka akan dicabut.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:15.685 --> 00:23:17.562
<font color="white">- Apa?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Mereka sudah gila, ya?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:23:17.646 --> 00:23:20.816
<font color="white">Itu justru akan membuat</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">lebih banyak dokter mogok kerja.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:23:26.988 --> 00:23:29.324
<font color="white">DR. MA SEONG-GYU</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:35.622 --> 00:23:37.707
<font color="white">DR. BAE HEUNG-GON</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:43.255 --> 00:23:44.422
<font color="white">Dia tak angkat telepon.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:45.674 --> 00:23:47.092
<font color="white">Dia tak pernah begini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:49.094 --> 00:23:51.096
<font color="white">Kurasa dia sengaja tak mengangkatnya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:51.179 --> 00:23:53.140
<font color="white">Tangguhkan dulu konferensi ini sekarang.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:23:53.223 --> 00:23:55.016
<font color="white">- Dalam situasi ini…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Tidak bisa.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:24:02.566 --> 00:24:03.567
<font color="white">Maksudku…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:04.776 --> 00:24:06.403
<font color="white">bagaimana nasib pasien itu?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:06.987 --> 00:24:09.573
<font color="white">MOLLY PERGI BERBELANJA</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:09.656 --> 00:24:11.616
<font color="white"><i>Berapa lama lagi dia harus menunggu?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:13.076 --> 00:24:15.328
{\an8}<font color="white">38 JAM SEBELUM MOGOK KERJA</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:15.412 --> 00:24:16.621
{\an8}<font color="white">Tolonglah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:17.789 --> 00:24:20.125
<font color="white">Aku mohon, Suster.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:21.251 --> 00:24:22.294
<font color="white">Maaf.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:22.377 --> 00:24:23.879
<font color="white">Maafkan aku.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:28.508 --> 00:24:30.886
<font color="white">Jadi, kami harus bagaimana?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:32.470 --> 00:24:34.181
<font color="white">Kami harus ke mana lagi?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:38.935 --> 00:24:40.228
<font color="white">Maafkan aku.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:24:58.496 --> 00:25:00.457
<font color="white">Si imut tersayang…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:25:01.333 --> 00:25:03.210
<font color="white">Si kecil tersayang…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:25:04.336 --> 00:25:06.213
<font color="white">Kakak kesayanganku…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:25:06.796 --> 00:25:08.590
<font color="white">Belahan jiwaku…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:25:09.466 --> 00:25:11.468
<font color="white">Permata hatiku…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:25:24.522 --> 00:25:25.523
<font color="white">Ibu…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:25:28.401 --> 00:25:29.402
<font color="white">Ayah…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:25:32.239 --> 00:25:33.365
<font color="white">Biarkan aku…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:25:34.699 --> 00:25:36.993
<font color="white">tinggal lebih lama sebelum menemui kalian.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:25:40.121 --> 00:25:41.539
<font color="white">Tolonglah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:25:44.084 --> 00:25:47.879
<font color="white">Siapa yang akan jaga Nenek dan Ga-yeong</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">jika aku tak ada?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:25:49.798 --> 00:25:51.132
<font color="white">Tolong aku.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:25:51.841 --> 00:25:53.093
<font color="white">Kumohon. Tolong aku.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:25:59.391 --> 00:26:02.060
<font color="white">Pusat penanganan anak, 'kan?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Kamar yang mana?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:26:02.143 --> 00:26:03.895
<font color="white">Sedang apa kau, Dokter Gye?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:26:03.979 --> 00:26:05.897
<font color="white">Duduklah, Gye.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:26:07.232 --> 00:26:08.066
<font color="white">Duduk.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:26:09.859 --> 00:26:10.860
<font color="white">Duduk!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:26:11.569 --> 00:26:14.531
<font color="white">Minimal Dokter Bae diberi camilan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">agar bisa buat Dokter Gye duduk.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:26:15.031 --> 00:26:16.783
<font color="white">Perlukah kau kusuntik obat penenang?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:26:16.866 --> 00:26:20.287
<font color="white">Jelaskan dan pergi, atau duduk saja.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:26:23.039 --> 00:26:26.251
<font color="white">"Dokter pengganti diizinkan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">melakukan operasi sesuai pilihannya".</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:26:27.043 --> 00:26:28.044
<font color="white">Salah satu klausulnya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:26:30.171 --> 00:26:32.299
<font color="white">Tak ada yang bisa membantumu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:26:32.382 --> 00:26:34.009
<font color="white">Satu dokter bedah saja takkan cukup…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:26:34.092 --> 00:26:35.635
<font color="white">- Cukup.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Apa?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:26:35.719 --> 00:26:37.595
<font color="white">Sudah kurencanakan semuanya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:26:38.263 --> 00:26:40.598
{\an8}<font color="white">Maksudmu, kau mau melakukan operasi solo?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:26:40.682 --> 00:26:42.517
{\an8}<font color="white">OPERASI DOKTER BEDAH UTAMA TANPA ASISTEN</font><font color="white"></font>

00:26:45.186 --> 00:26:46.021
<font color="white">Sepertinya begitu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:26:46.813 --> 00:26:50.692
<font color="white">Dengar, rumah sakit tak bisa tinggal diam</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan biarkan operasi berisiko ini</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:26:50.775 --> 00:26:53.486
<font color="white">dilakukan sendirian tanpa asisten.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:26:53.570 --> 00:26:56.406
<font color="white">Jangan sembarangan begitu</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">meski mengantongi gelar spesialis.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:26:56.489 --> 00:26:58.241
<font color="white">Bagaimana jika terjadi kesalahan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:26:58.325 --> 00:26:59.159
<font color="white">Kalau begitu…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:27:00.327 --> 00:27:01.369
<font color="white">kapan mulainya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:27:02.954 --> 00:27:05.415
<font color="white">Kita tunggu dokter bedah bersedia,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">lalu cocokkan jadwal dokter lain.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:27:05.498 --> 00:27:07.083
<font color="white">Tapi ruang operasi tak dibuka untuknya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:27:07.625 --> 00:27:08.626
<font color="white">Jadi, sampai kapan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:27:09.252 --> 00:27:13.048
<font color="white">Takkan ada yang mau menyempatkan diri</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">atau berhenti mogok demi operasinya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

