<font color="white">Mau tetap jadi dokter umum saja?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:48.729 --> 00:35:51.232
<font color="white">Tadinya kukira</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">aku bisa selamatkan pasienku.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:35:53.734 --> 00:35:55.153
<font color="white">Aku sangat marah</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:56.320 --> 00:35:59.949
<font color="white">saat dia merasa kesakitan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan memohon agar aku membiarkannya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:36:00.783 --> 00:36:02.243
<font color="white">Aku tak bisa menerimanya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:03.536 --> 00:36:05.621
<font color="white">Aku terus berpikir,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">"Kenapa tak bisa menyelamatkannya?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:36:06.205 --> 00:36:08.166
<font color="white">Kenapa dia masih kesakitan?"</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:08.249 --> 00:36:10.042
<font color="white">Meski aku membiarkannya,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:11.043 --> 00:36:12.461
<font color="white">aku tak menangis.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:14.338 --> 00:36:15.798
<font color="white">Tapi dia tersenyum dan bilang…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:18.259 --> 00:36:19.385
<font color="white">tidak sakit lagi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:23.222 --> 00:36:24.265
<font color="white">Jadi…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:25.683 --> 00:36:27.894
<font color="white">selamatkan pasienmu, ya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:35.943 --> 00:36:39.989
<font color="white"><i>Anak-anak itu mungkin kesakitan sekarang.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:40.531 --> 00:36:41.782
<font color="white">Kak Ga-eul.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:42.575 --> 00:36:43.951
<font color="white">Sakit sekali, ya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:45.328 --> 00:36:46.913
<font color="white">Perlu kupanggil dokter?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:48.706 --> 00:36:49.582
<font color="white">Tak apa-apa.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:50.166 --> 00:36:52.835
<font color="white">Kenapa bangun, Hyeon-a? Sulit tidur lagi?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:53.628 --> 00:36:54.712
<font color="white">Aku mau memberimu ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:55.755 --> 00:36:58.883
<font color="white">Kau harus disuntik saat sakit.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:58.966 --> 00:37:01.677
<font color="white">Tapi kau urungkan niatmu</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">karena butuh biaya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:37:02.386 --> 00:37:03.846
<font color="white">Kuberikan itu untukmu,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:03.930 --> 00:37:06.224
<font color="white">agar kau bisa memanggil dokter hari ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:06.724 --> 00:37:07.683
<font color="white">Terima kasih.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:08.392 --> 00:37:11.062
<font color="white">Tapi aku tak membutuhkannya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:11.687 --> 00:37:13.189
<font color="white">Aku akan dioperasi besok.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:13.898 --> 00:37:15.399
<font color="white">Aku cuma perlu bertahan sebentar.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:18.444 --> 00:37:21.155
<font color="white">Tapi operasimu bisa ditunda lagi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:22.156 --> 00:37:24.742
<font color="white">Dokter sering menghilang.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:26.118 --> 00:37:27.286
<font color="white">Tidak.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:27.370 --> 00:37:31.082
<font color="white">Suster bilang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dokternya tak akan menghilang.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:37:31.165 --> 00:37:33.584
<font color="white">Benarkah? Syukurlah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:36.045 --> 00:37:38.881
<font color="white"><i>Semoga hari esok segera tiba,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:39.674 --> 00:37:40.675
<font color="white"><i>Mi-gyeong.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:54.605 --> 00:37:55.606
<font color="white">Sudah kutemukan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:59.944 --> 00:38:02.571
{\an8}<font color="white">KASUS 1</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">GANGLIONEUROBLASTOMA RETROPERITONEAL</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:38:14.208 --> 00:38:15.042
<font color="white">Apakah ini…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:16.085 --> 00:38:17.169
<font color="white">Snuggles?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:21.299 --> 00:38:22.174
<font color="white"><i>Dokter.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:23.134 --> 00:38:24.135
<font color="white"><i>- Dokter!</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>- Dokter Gye.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:24.927 --> 00:38:25.928
<font color="white"><i>- Dokter!</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Dokter Gye.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:38:30.683 --> 00:38:34.687
<font color="white">Ayolah, Stik Penambah Tenaga.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Bangunkan dia.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:38:41.235 --> 00:38:44.280
<font color="white">Aku tahu kami terpaksa tutup IGD</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">karena tak ada pelayanan definitif,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:38:44.363 --> 00:38:46.157
<font color="white">tapi kelakuan macam apa ini?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:46.240 --> 00:38:49.201
<font color="white">Kau pikir IGD ini lelucon</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">karena kami terpaksa tutup?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:38:49.285 --> 00:38:51.078
<font color="white">Ini cuma untuk beberapa hari.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:51.162 --> 00:38:52.872
<font color="white">IGD ditutup?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:53.789 --> 00:38:55.666
<font color="white">Benarkah? Aku tak tahu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:57.293 --> 00:38:58.294
<font color="white">Ada pengumuman di depan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:59.211 --> 00:39:01.130
<font color="white"><i>Kurasa kau tak melihatnya.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:01.213 --> 00:39:02.214
<font color="white">PEMBERITAHUAN PENUTUPAN IGD</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:04.383 --> 00:39:05.843
<font color="white">Kami tak bisa terima pasien</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">setelah tengah malam.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:39:07.136 --> 00:39:08.095
<font color="white">Baru kali ini kualami.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:08.179 --> 00:39:09.930
<font color="white">Padahal enam tahun lalu saat COVID-19,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">kami tetap buka.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:39:10.598 --> 00:39:12.933
<font color="white">Kini sekitar 70 % magang dan residen</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">melakukan aksi mogok.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:39:14.685 --> 00:39:16.395
<font color="white">Kondisinya berbeda dengan waktu itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:16.479 --> 00:39:17.396
<font color="white">Kirim pasien itu padaku.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:17.480 --> 00:39:19.315
<font color="white">Kenapa? Apa kau punya sepuluh kembaran?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:19.398 --> 00:39:20.483
<font color="white">Cuma sepuluh?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:21.067 --> 00:39:22.943
<font color="white">Hei, si perusak suasana, Won-jin,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">langkahmu senyap.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:39:23.027 --> 00:39:24.779
<font color="white">Kau mau mengajaknya pergi?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:24.862 --> 00:39:26.238
<font color="white">Kau terlihat baik-baik saja.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:26.822 --> 00:39:30.076
<font color="white">Kukira kau mengamuk dan berteriak,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">"Kalian sebut diri kalian dokter?"</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:39:30.159 --> 00:39:32.912
<font color="white">lalu mencari pojokan untuk menangis,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">"Aku menyesal."</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:39:34.038 --> 00:39:35.039
<font color="white">Aku?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:35.623 --> 00:39:36.749
<font color="white">Kau salah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:36.832 --> 00:39:38.167
<font color="white">Mustahil aku begitu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:38.918 --> 00:39:39.877
<font color="white">Mau ke mana kau?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:42.380 --> 00:39:45.216
<font color="white">Kalian sebut diri kalian dokter?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:46.425 --> 00:39:47.551
<font color="white">Aku menyesal.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:48.886 --> 00:39:50.679
<font color="white">Aku tak bisa melindungi IGD.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:53.974 --> 00:39:56.060
<font color="white">Apa? Aku baik-baik saja.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:56.143 --> 00:39:57.686
<font color="white">Tidurku nyenyak, jadi aku merasa bugar.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:00.981 --> 00:40:03.109
<font color="white">Itu pasti telepon rujukan pasien!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:03.776 --> 00:40:05.611
<font color="white">Lalu kenapa matanya merah?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:06.153 --> 00:40:07.405
<font color="white">Dan kenapa kau di sini?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:07.488 --> 00:40:08.406
<font color="white">Cuma ingin di sini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:09.365 --> 00:40:11.242
<font color="white">Aku tak sabar menunggu hari esok tiba,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:11.325 --> 00:40:12.952
<font color="white">jadi datang lebih awal untuk menunggu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:13.035 --> 00:40:15.204
<font color="white">Dokter Kim benar-benar menularimu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:15.287 --> 00:40:17.915
<font color="white">Kini Tae-gyeong dan lainnya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">juga cengeng seperti dia.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:40:21.043 --> 00:40:22.878
<font color="white">- Kami tak punya kamar besar.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Ayo.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:40:22.962 --> 00:40:24.839
<font color="white">Tidak, fasilitas kami tak begitu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:26.715 --> 00:40:30.010
<font color="white">Hei, jangan bertingkah sok keren</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">saat pergi.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:40:30.094 --> 00:40:31.637
<font color="white">Kenapa harus tampak keren</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">saat mau ke ruang operasi?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:40:33.305 --> 00:40:35.433
<font color="white">Aku juga mau.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:36.142 --> 00:40:37.017
<font color="white">"Penyedotan".</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:41.897 --> 00:40:42.815
<font color="white">Dokter Ma.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:43.649 --> 00:40:44.859
<font color="white">Kenapa kau ke sini?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:46.569 --> 00:40:48.446
<font color="white">Kau sungguh mau berkemas?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:48.529 --> 00:40:50.531
<font color="white">- Yakin mau keluar?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Kau tetap di sini, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:40:51.991 --> 00:40:53.325
<font color="white">Ya, aku tetap di sini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:53.868 --> 00:40:56.036
<font color="white">Tetaplah di sini juga.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:58.456 --> 00:40:59.290
<font color="white">Kembalilah bekerja.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:01.584 --> 00:41:04.795
{\an8}<font color="white">Kau mengejar sertifikasi spesialis ganda,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">jadi tak ada waktu senggang.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:41:04.879 --> 00:41:08.132
{\an8}<font color="white">Pasien melihat wawancaramu</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan mereka sangat terkejut…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:41:08.215 --> 00:41:09.675
<font color="white">Apa gunanya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:10.926 --> 00:41:11.760
<font color="white">Apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:11.844 --> 00:41:15.139
<font color="white">Kenapa harus bersusah payah menjadi</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dokter bedah spesialis ganda?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:41:16.056 --> 00:41:17.057
<font color="white">Memangnya itu penting?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:17.850 --> 00:41:20.436
<font color="white">Mereka tak peduli,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tinggal bilang cari orang lain lagi.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:41:21.103 --> 00:41:23.189
<font color="white">Beginilah cara mereka memperlakukan kita</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:23.272 --> 00:41:26.275
<font color="white">setelah bertahun-tahun belajar</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan membanting tulang.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:41:27.485 --> 00:41:29.945
<font color="white">Bukannya mempertahankan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">pekerja medis yang ada,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:41:30.738 --> 00:41:32.698
<font color="white">mereka justru cetak lebih banyak dokter</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">untuk bekerja.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:41:32.781 --> 00:41:35.034
<font color="white">Memangnya kita mesin?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:36.452 --> 00:41:37.411
<font color="white">Dokter Ma.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:41.582 --> 00:41:43.876
<font color="white">Ini buku yang kupinjam darimu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:43.959 --> 00:41:45.961
<font color="white">- Sudahlah. Itu untukmu.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Jangan, kumohon.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:41:46.504 --> 00:41:47.338
<font color="white">Tolong baca lagi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:48.172 --> 00:41:49.256
<font color="white">Kumohon.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:50.382 --> 00:41:51.550
<font color="white">Sedang apa kau?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:52.092 --> 00:41:53.802
<font color="white">Jangan halangi dia.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:55.262 --> 00:41:57.181
<font color="white">PENYAKIT GASTROINTESTINAL DAN LEVER</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:18.536 --> 00:42:20.329
<font color="white">RAPAT KOMITE DARURAT SOAL MASALAH MENDESAK</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:20.412 --> 00:42:22.164
<font color="white">AGENDA: PEMUNGUTAN SUARA</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">AKSI MOGOK MAGANG DAN RESIDEN</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:42:23.123 --> 00:42:24.208
<font color="white">Langsung ambil suara?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:24.833 --> 00:42:26.293
<font color="white">Seharusnya secara daring, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:26.377 --> 00:42:29.255
<font color="white">Jika anonim, bagaimana cara</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">menyingkirkan pengkhianatnya?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:42:29.338 --> 00:42:30.548
<font color="white">Jika dilewatkan, kau pengkhianat.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:30.631 --> 00:42:31.632
<font color="white">Begitukah pemungutan suara?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:31.715 --> 00:42:33.300
<font color="white">Sudah kuduga kau tak mau ikut.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:33.384 --> 00:42:36.804
<font color="white">Ayahmu pemilik rumah sakit,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">jadi kau tak peduli, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:42:40.599 --> 00:42:42.810
<font color="white">Ya, aku tak peduli.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:42.893 --> 00:42:45.187
<font color="white">Ya ampun, aku benci nada bicaramu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:45.271 --> 00:42:48.107
<font color="white">- Hei, kenapa kau ke sini?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Apa?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:42:48.190 --> 00:42:50.234
<font color="white">Kau lulusan Universitas Yeongsin.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:51.068 --> 00:42:53.529
<font color="white">Jujur saja. Kampusmu jauh lebih bergengsi</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:53.612 --> 00:42:55.072
<font color="white">daripada kampus pinggiran seperti Guseo.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:56.282 --> 00:42:57.658
<font color="white">Dan kau di cabangnya pula.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:57.741 --> 00:42:59.368
<font color="white">Terlalu sadar diri, ya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:59.868 --> 00:43:01.245
<font color="white">Hei, Park Tae-gyeong.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:01.328 --> 00:43:02.997
<font color="white">Kau tak bikin masalah di sana.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:03.080 --> 00:43:05.791
<font color="white">Jadi, kenapa kau keluar dari sana</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan datang ke sini?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:43:06.333 --> 00:43:08.502
<font color="white">- Kalian lihat riwayatku?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Dunia ini sempit.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:43:08.586 --> 00:43:10.129
<font color="white">Jadi, mudah bertanya ke mana-mana.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:10.879 --> 00:43:13.132
<font color="white">Dari 140.000 dokter di Korea,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:13.215 --> 00:43:15.593
<font color="white">sekitar 8.000-an</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">berstatus magang dan residen.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:43:15.676 --> 00:43:19.346
<font color="white">Sebanyak 8.000 orang itulah</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang menggerakkan rumah sakit universitas.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:43:19.430 --> 00:43:22.975
<font color="white">Tapi setelah bekerja keras untuk mereka,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">kami malah ditusuk dari belakang.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:43:23.726 --> 00:43:26.895
<font color="white">Dan dari 8.000 orang itu,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">kaulah pengkhianat terbesar.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:43:27.479 --> 00:43:29.690
<font color="white">Kenapa kau ke sini</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">untuk mengacaukan aksi kami?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:43:29.773 --> 00:43:31.025
<font color="white">Kau menurunkan jumlah kami.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:31.108 --> 00:43:34.653
<font color="white">Karena ayah bajingan egois ini</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">direktur rumah sakit tempatnya bersandar.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:43:38.949 --> 00:43:39.783
<font color="white">Hei.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:40.784 --> 00:43:42.786
<font color="white">Bukankah itu berlaku</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">bagi kita semua di sini?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:43:44.997 --> 00:43:47.958
<font color="white">Memangnya ada yang bukan anak dokter?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:49.084 --> 00:43:50.294
<font color="white">Ayahmu dokter spesialis mata.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:51.003 --> 00:43:52.379
<font color="white">Ibumu dokter spesialis kulit.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:52.463 --> 00:43:53.422
<font color="white">Dan ayah atau ibumu…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:54.506 --> 00:43:55.924
<font color="white">dokter hewan, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:56.008 --> 00:43:58.177
<font color="white">- Makanya kau minder.</font><font color="white">
