<font color="white">Katanya sebagai pasien,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:30.498 --> 00:53:32.876
<font color="white">dia baru paham rasanya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">jika operasi ditunda.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:53:32.959 --> 00:53:34.294
<font color="white">Biasanya dia tak begitu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:34.377 --> 00:53:36.254
<font color="white">Itu tak benar.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:36.338 --> 00:53:39.382
<font color="white">Dia sangat berdedikasi</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">saat menangani kasus pasiennya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:53:39.466 --> 00:53:42.302
<font color="white">Masalahnya, dia sendiri juga pasien.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:52.187 --> 00:53:54.564
<font color="white">Dokter Kim.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Tadi Dokter Hwang di sini, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:53:54.648 --> 00:53:56.775
<font color="white">Ya, mereka baru membawanya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">ke ruang operasi.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:53:56.858 --> 00:53:58.735
<font color="white">Apa? Siapa yang mengoperasinya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:58.818 --> 00:54:01.154
<font color="white">Tak ada dokter bedah umum.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:02.238 --> 00:54:03.281
<font color="white">Dokter Bae, ya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:04.240 --> 00:54:05.325
<font color="white">Dokter Kim.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:05.825 --> 00:54:07.077
<font color="white">Bagaimana keadaan Dokter Hwang?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:21.424 --> 00:54:23.969
<font color="white">Operasi solo untuk laparoskopi?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:24.761 --> 00:54:26.221
<font color="white">Ini gila.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:27.013 --> 00:54:30.892
{\an8}<font color="white">Lobektomi kaudatus laparoskopi secara solo</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:30.976 --> 00:54:34.187
{\an8}<font color="white">baru pernah kulihat sekali</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">di Johns Hopkins.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:54:34.270 --> 00:54:35.146
<font color="white">Cuma sedikit dokter…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:36.189 --> 00:54:38.942
<font color="white">yang bisa melakukannya di Korea.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:39.025 --> 00:54:40.527
<font color="white">Dokter Gye sedang membuktikan…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:42.070 --> 00:54:43.697
<font color="white">dia salah satu dokter itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:48.076 --> 00:54:51.579
<font color="white">Dokter Gye, bagaimana dengan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">operasi Yoo Ga-eul pukul 12 siang?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:54:51.663 --> 00:54:52.664
<font color="white">Pukul 12 siang?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:53.623 --> 00:54:55.291
<font color="white">Sudah pukul 11 lewat.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:55.375 --> 00:54:56.876
<font color="white">Makanya pakai metode laparoskopi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:57.460 --> 00:54:59.212
<font color="white">Katanya bisa ke sana pukul 12 siang.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:03.341 --> 00:55:05.260
<font color="white">- Kau bisa menangguhkan…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Tidak.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:55:05.760 --> 00:55:07.095
<font color="white">Bagaimanapun, aku harus ke sana.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:08.013 --> 00:55:10.390
<font color="white">Tak kubiarkan dia menderita lebih lama,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">semenit pun.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:55:17.522 --> 00:55:18.606
<font color="white">Ayolah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:19.774 --> 00:55:21.693
<font color="white">Hanya sedikit lebih cepat.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:23.153 --> 00:55:24.320
<font color="white">Lebih cepat…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:38.752 --> 00:55:40.211
<font color="white">Kurasa dia bisa melakukannya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:41.296 --> 00:55:42.255
<font color="white">Ya, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:43.965 --> 00:55:44.799
<font color="white">Syukurlah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:47.302 --> 00:55:49.054
<font color="white">Aku masih ada operasi, Pak.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:49.137 --> 00:55:50.972
<font color="white">Aku juga, Pak.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:05.820 --> 00:56:06.654
<font color="white">Dokter Bae.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:07.822 --> 00:56:08.698
<font color="white">Ya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:09.991 --> 00:56:10.992
<font color="white">Menurutmu…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:13.411 --> 00:56:14.996
<font color="white">apakah kita gagal?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:18.458 --> 00:56:19.626
<font color="white">Apa maksudmu?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:20.335 --> 00:56:23.797
<font color="white">Tugasnya di ruang operasi besar itu</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sangat berat.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:56:23.880 --> 00:56:26.883
<font color="white">Tak ada asisten,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">jadi dia hanya mengandalkan diri sendiri.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:56:28.051 --> 00:56:30.386
<font color="white">Dan dia masih pakai laparoskop</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">untuk selamatkan nyawa.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:56:30.470 --> 00:56:31.471
<font color="white">Kau tahu,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:32.055 --> 00:56:33.681
<font color="white">orang gila operasi itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:35.934 --> 00:56:37.185
<font color="white">Baru kali ini,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:37.977 --> 00:56:39.646
<font color="white">tak kulihat dia</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sebagai orang gila operasi,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:56:40.563 --> 00:56:42.982
<font color="white">tapi sebagai Gye Su-jeong,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dokter penyelamat nyawa.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:56:48.029 --> 00:56:48.947
<font color="white">Sudah kalah, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:51.783 --> 00:56:54.702
<font color="white">Aksi mogok kerja kali ini</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">jadi tampak sepele.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:56:59.165 --> 00:57:00.750
<font color="white">Kurasa dia akan segera selesai.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:01.417 --> 00:57:02.460
<font color="white">Mungkin dia</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:03.211 --> 00:57:06.047
<font color="white">bahkan sempat makan roti lapis</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sebelum operasi berikutnya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:57:11.136 --> 00:57:12.345
<font color="white">Seong-gyu…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:14.514 --> 00:57:15.765
<font color="white">tidak muncul.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:15.849 --> 00:57:18.560
<font color="white">Dia bersama Ketua Kim dan Wali Kota Im…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:18.643 --> 00:57:20.019
<font color="white">Aku mendukung aksi mogok ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:20.520 --> 00:57:22.313
<font color="white">Aku berpihak padanya, tapi…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:23.857 --> 00:57:26.192
<font color="white">Seharusnya Seong-gyu melihat operasi itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:27.277 --> 00:57:29.112
<font color="white">Dia harus mengamatinya</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:29.654 --> 00:57:31.239
<font color="white">karena dengan begitu,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:31.823 --> 00:57:34.367
<font color="white">dia bisa belajar banyak.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:36.244 --> 00:57:39.289
<font color="white">Rasanya dia melewatkan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">setiap momen berharga.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:57:43.543 --> 00:57:46.379
{\an8}<font color="white">25 JAM SEBELUM MOGOK KERJA</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:46.463 --> 00:57:48.840
<font color="white">RAPAT KOMITE DARURAT</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">MAGANG DAN RESIDEN TAHUN 2026</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:57:50.216 --> 00:57:51.968
<font color="white">Kita akan mulai begitu wartawan tiba.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:52.051 --> 00:57:54.220
<font color="white">Sebaiknya kerjamu bagus.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Aku akan mengawasimu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:57:54.304 --> 00:57:57.056
<font color="white">- Cukup. Naiklah ke panggung.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Baik, tentu saja.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:58:04.314 --> 00:58:08.318
<font color="white">Jika kau melihat orang tuamu saat tidur,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:58:08.401 --> 00:58:09.944
<font color="white">jangan ikut mereka.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:58:10.528 --> 00:58:11.446
<font color="white">Paham?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:58:13.948 --> 00:58:16.659
<font color="white">Aku masih berharap bisa melihat mereka.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:58:18.286 --> 00:58:20.955
<font color="white">Kak Ga-eul, jika kau melihat Ayah dan Ibu,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:58:21.039 --> 00:58:23.249
<font color="white">minta mereka melihatku dalam mimpi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:58:23.333 --> 00:58:25.418
<font color="white">Aku tak begitu ingat wajah mereka,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:58:25.502 --> 00:58:28.838
<font color="white">jadi mereka harus beri tahu aku</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">bahwa mereka ayah dan ibuku.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:58:28.922 --> 00:58:31.633
<font color="white">Kau harus beri tahu mereka, oke?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:58:32.550 --> 00:58:33.801
<font color="white">Baiklah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:58:49.192 --> 00:58:50.860
<font color="white">Tinggal 22 menit.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:59:01.329 --> 00:59:02.789
<font color="white">Sedikit lagi…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:59:27.605 --> 00:59:28.982
<font color="white">Tunggu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:59:29.065 --> 00:59:30.441
<font color="white">Kerja…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:59:31.317 --> 00:59:32.944
<font color="white">Kerja bagus, Dok.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:59:39.242 --> 00:59:40.785
<font color="white">SIROP</font><font color="white"></font>

00:59:45.623 --> 00:59:46.916
<font color="white">MINUMAN BERENERGI</font><font color="white"></font>

00:59:51.254 --> 00:59:55.258
<font color="white">Semua rumah sakit universitas</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">punya patung itu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:59:55.341 --> 00:59:58.011
<font color="white">Mahasiswa baru</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sering mengambil foto di depannya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:59:58.094 --> 01:00:00.722
<font color="white">Patung di sini cukup besar.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:00:04.559 --> 01:00:08.354
<font color="white">Konon dia dijuluki Dokter X.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:00:10.481 --> 01:00:13.234
<font color="white">- Maaf?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Dokter Bae dan Dokter Ma temukan artikel</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:00:13.318 --> 01:00:17.196
<font color="white">saat mencari referensi</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">prosedur bedah Pak Park Gwang-cheol.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:00:18.865 --> 01:00:22.327
<font color="white">Katanya seseorang dengan julukan Dokter X</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">melakukan prosedur yang sama.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:00:24.454 --> 01:00:25.413
<font color="white">Begitukah?</font><font color="white"></font>

01:00:26.456 --> 01:00:29.584
<font color="white">Dunia ini luas,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">ada berbagai macam prosedur bedah</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:00:29.667 --> 01:00:31.711
<font color="white">dan dokter yang menggunakannya.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:00:32.587 --> 01:00:34.005
<font color="white">Awalnya aku tak percaya.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:00:34.589 --> 01:00:37.759
<font color="white">Tentu saja tidak.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Kenapa percaya pada rumor begitu?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:00:37.842 --> 01:00:39.135
<font color="white">Akan tetapi,</font><font color="white"></font>

01:00:39.218 --> 01:00:40.887
<font color="white">setelah menyaksikan operasi tadi,</font><font color="white"></font>

01:00:40.970 --> 01:00:43.348
<font color="white">aku jadi sadar</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">bahwa rumor itu bisa saja benar.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:00:45.725 --> 01:00:47.268
<font color="white">Apa maksudmu?</font><font color="white"></font>

01:00:50.146 --> 01:00:53.691
<font color="white"><i>Dokter Gye dan Dokter Ma seumuran.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:00:53.775 --> 01:00:56.819
<font color="white">Untuk bisa punya bakat bedah</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang luar biasa begitu</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:00:56.903 --> 01:00:59.530
<font color="white">dan rela mempertaruhkan segalanya…</font><font color="white"></font>

01:00:59.614 --> 01:01:00.740
<font color="white">Direktur Bu.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:01:00.823 --> 01:01:02.367
<font color="white">Dokter Gye memang</font><font color="white"></font>

01:01:02.992 --> 01:01:04.619
<font color="white">genius dan luar biasa.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:01:04.702 --> 01:01:07.121
<font color="white">Tapi dia juga pekerja keras.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:01:07.705 --> 01:01:10.500
<font color="white">Sungguh disayangkan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">kau meragukannya begitu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:01:13.419 --> 01:01:16.464
<font color="white">Saat patung Hipokrates itu dan sumpahnya</font><font color="white"></font>

01:01:17.215 --> 01:01:18.841
<font color="white">cuma dijadikan latar belakang foto</font><font color="white"></font>

01:01:18.925 --> 01:01:22.845
<font color="white">atau sebagai properti pajangan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">untuk mendukung aksi mogok kerja,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:01:23.388 --> 01:01:26.432
<font color="white">aku jadi penasaran</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">siapa Gye Su-jeong sebenarnya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:01:32.855 --> 01:01:33.981
<font color="white">Kurasa sudah cukup.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:01:34.941 --> 01:01:36.859
<font color="white">Permisi. Waktu operasi hampir tiba.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:01:37.443 --> 01:01:38.653
<font color="white">Apakah Gye Su-jeong…</font><font color="white"></font>

01:01:40.321 --> 01:01:41.614
<font color="white">Apakah Gye Su-jeong…</font><font color="white"></font>

01:01:58.339 --> 01:02:00.258
<font color="white">Mari mulai operasi.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:02:06.180 --> 01:02:07.849
<font color="white">DURASI OPERASI, WAKTU, DURASI ANESTESIA</font><font color="white"></font>

01:02:08.891 --> 01:02:10.476
<font color="white"><i>Apakah Gye Su-jeong…</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:02:13.396 --> 01:02:16.232
<font color="white">Dokter X?</font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:00.151 --> 01:03:03.112
<font color="white">DOCTOR X: MAFIA IN WHITE</font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:42.235 --> 01:03:45.196
<font color="white">DOCTOR X: MAFIA IN WHITE</font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:45.279 --> 01:03:48.032
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Kita harus pergi dari rumah sakit itu.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:48.115 --> 01:03:49.492
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Aku harus mengoperasinya.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:49.575 --> 01:03:52.912
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Jangan, kau akan makin terlihat</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>mirip Dokter X.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:52.995 --> 01:03:54.789
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Sama sekali tak ada tindakan bedah.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:54.872 --> 01:03:56.874
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Anak itu tak punya waktu lagi.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:56.958 --> 01:03:58.543
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Apa kau mempertaruhkan nyawa pasien</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:58.626 --> 01:04:01.087
{\an8}<font color="white">untuk membahayakan karier orang lain?</font><font color="white"></font>

01:04:01.170 --> 01:04:03.965
{\an8}<font color="white">Aku berusaha menyelamatkan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">pasien berumur delapan tahun.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:04:04.549 --> 01:04:05.967
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Jika kau mengoperasinya,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:04:06.050 --> 01:04:07.468
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>kau akan benar-benar kupecat.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:04:07.552 --> 01:04:09.887
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Menurutmu, ada yang berpartisipasi?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:04:09.971 --> 01:04:10.888
{\an8}<font color="white">Tolonglah.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:04:12.098 --> 01:04:16.769
{\an8}<font color="white">Terjemahan subtitle oleh Alex</font><font color="white"></font>
